  "name": "Fire Cloak",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Fire_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You wrap your body in cascading flames that scorch enemies when they approach.</p><p>You gain <strong>+1 Armor</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>While enveloped in the fire cloak, any other creature that enters or starts its turn within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you suffers <strong>1 Damage</strong>, which ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can increase both the <strong>Damage </strong>and the <strong>Armor</strong> bonus by <strong>+1</strong> per two extra successes<strong>.</strong></p>",
